WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.840
This is your city.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.020
Every chapter has its own home.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:08.120
The Daily Pulse is a short briefing every morning with the news that matters.

00:00:08.539 --> 00:00:11.440
The boards are where people post jobs, things for sale,

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.920
fosters and rescues.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.340
You'll find what is happening this week and the places

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.760
members vouch for most.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:19.640
We want to hear from you.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.360
As a member, you shape your city.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.240
Comment on the Pulse.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.000
Post on the boards.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:27.600
Send us a hot tip.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.340
Let us know if something needs to be fixed,

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.640
and vouch for your chapter.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.720
Do not see your city yet?

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.120
Vouch for where we should go next.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:39.280
Membership is free.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.520
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:45.900
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:50.020
And the best way to bring your city to life is to bring people in:

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:54.480
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans,

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.500
so they can use these tools with you.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:00.200
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:05.240
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:05.820
community.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.099
Find your city, and say hello.

